                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was another nice entry to the series. I liked that the games eventually kind of \"pass the torch\" and still have Dawn but also introduce new characters as well.\r\n\r\nAnd from a story perspective just to follow that thread since I kind of open with it, it's a direct continuation of the other games in the series, unlike some that can become unrelated or unclear how they connect, which is always a plus for me. But the game, as you probably see from the cover art, is in the vein of, \"different cultures have the same things but refer to them by different names.\" So there is demon-hunting that incorporated elements of Egyptian mythology, though it's unclear in these games how true they are to genuine Egyptian mythology versus what just works for the narrative in the game; though this is fine with me because I think it's clear to everyone that this shouldn't be taken as a definitive source of cultural information.\r\n\r\nAll that out of the way, the gameplay was fine. I don't think there were really any puzzles I found to be really challenging, nothing that tripped me up for long (except for Anubis' challenge which was fun to figure out), but it was enjoyable enough to play though and really I am just personally looking for a nice relaxing experience from these kinds of games.\r\n\r\nThe music and voice acting was fine. The music wasn't anything I found myself humming after the fact or anything, but it is more ambient in nature and just there to kind of fill the space along with the background noises and things.\r\n\r\nThe game has collectibles to find, and the HUD indicator for if there is a collectible in that scene returns as well which I was glad for since keeping track of which places you have found the collectibles for can be challenging sometimes unless you make sure it's the first thing.\r\n\r\nI did not have any technical issues with this game.\r\nThis game does have collectibles.\r\nThis game does have a bonus adventure.",
